{"id":"wenbao-official-dress-lora-ipadapter-openpose-cutout","revision":0,"last_node_id":28,"last_link_id":30,"nodes":[{"id":11,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[40,-40],"size":[820,659.25],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"官方礼服 OFFICIAL（LoRA+锁脸+锁姿+草稿抠图；760 用脚本）","properties":{},"widgets_values":["# 官方礼服管线 OFFICIAL DRESS（多阶段，非纯文生）\n\n文件名保持 `MeinaMix_雯宝LoRA_换装抠图`，供脚本/对接识别。\n\n## 阶段（按图从左到右）\n1. **底模 + 角色 LoRA**：meinamix_v12Final + `xiaoyan.safetensors`（~0.80）\n2. **锁脸 IPAdapter**：`待机状态.png` + PLUS FACE，权重 ~0.80（长相靠参考+LoRA，正向不要写发型瞳色）\n3. **锁姿 OpenPose + ControlNet**：姿势参考默认 `xiaoyan_pose_stand_clean.png`，强度 ~0.85；先看「骨架预览」再出图\n4. **采样出图** → 保存 **Wenbao_Raw**（RGB 原图）\n5. **草稿抠图** ImageColorToMask→Invert→GrowMask(-2)→FeatherMask(2)→JoinAlpha → **Wenbao_Cutout**\n   - 白裙/白袜仍可能被颜色键咬掉，**不当正式衣柜源**\n6. **正式 760 RGBA**（仓库脚本，不在本图里跑完）：\n   ```\n   python tools/deliver-dress-frame.py <Wenbao_Raw.png> --name dress-xxx.png --check-spec\n   ```\n   输出 `tools/out/wenbao-assets/dress/`（脚底≈748，中心x≈380）\n\n## 不是什么\n- 无锁脸/锁姿的纯文生 = unofficial，不当正式帧\n- card 走独立 512×640 CG，不当衣服层\n- 详见 `tools/PIPELINE-DRESS.md` / `tools/PIPELINE-OFFICIAL.md`\n"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":4,"type":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","pos":[40,260],"size":[340,127.328125],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"Checkpoint名称","name":"ckpt_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"ckpt_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[1]},{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","slot_index":1,"links":[2]},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","slot_index":2,"links":[22]}],"title":"1. 加载动漫底模 (MeinaMix)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.28.0"},"widgets_values":["meinamix_v12Final.safetensors"]},{"id":12,"type":"LoraLoader","pos":[420,250],"size":[340,167.328125],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"mod